  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health &#x2013;Nutrition &#x2013; PSS - Protection. SEMA, under this project, aims to scale up the health, MHPSS and protection response to address the life-threatening needs of people affected by twelve years of war, where these needs are exacerbated by the earthquake  in NWS, using different and integrated modalities</narrative>
